'''BBL Esports''' is a [[:Category:Turkey|Turkish]] professional esports organization currently located in [[wikipedia:Istanbul|Istanbul]], [[:category:Turkey|Turkey]] and founded in July 2020 by Ferit '''"[[WtcN|wtcN]]"''' Karakaya, Kemalcan '''"Kendine Müzisyen"''' Parlak and Okan '''"Oidemirel"''' Demirel.

